{"kind": "mod", "id": 2524, "name": "Item Limits Begone!", "slug": "item-limits-begone", "teaser": "Removes in-raid, inventory, and flea listing limits for all items. Also changes back pack stack limit to 42.", "owner_name": "acidphantasm", "downloads": 13017, "favourites": 42, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.acidphantasm.itemlimitsbegone", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-08-06T06:02:14.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-12-31T17:41:41.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-12-31T17:41:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "1.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backpack stack limit\n<ul>\n<li>Limit Changed: 7 → 42</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Remove In-Raid Item limits <em>(How much of something you can carry in raid)</em>\n<ul>\n<li>Example: 1m Roubles → No Limit</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Remove Inventory Item limits <em>(How much of something you can bring into raid)</em>\n<ul>\n<li>Example: 500k Roubles → No Limit</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Remove Flea Listing limits <em>(How much of something you can list on the flea)</em>\n<ul>\n<li>Example: 6 Virtex → No Limit</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download Item Limits Begone</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"34vXXDj.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div cla